                                                "sense_id": "9070f0eb-b2e4-34d9-a4ba-bbd08b0542da",
                                                "text": "According to the ATF, gun makers began cranking out 2.4 million rifles annually in Obama’s first term – a 52 percent increase from the previous four years of the Bush administration."
                                            },
