                                                "example_id": "03a78b00-8ed5-4654-bbd2-8db3f13b50c3",
                                                "sense_id": "9070f0eb-b2e4-34d9-a4ba-bbd08b0542da",
                                                "text": "During Tuesday’s ceremony at the ATF headquarters, Dettelbach said being sworn in as the agency’s director is the “single greatest honor of my professional life” but also that it is “most certainly the greatest professional challenge of my life.”"
                                            }
